spall.seed_void boxes. Legs run for one step (plotfile 00001) unless stated; serial, -np 4.

  (i)   FLAT_P vs FLAT_X (path vs position, same deck): per-cell fl_h ratio median within 1 %, max 6 %;
        fl_H_stag = jet_s_c (the printed tokens) on every row
  (ii)  fl_s vs the analytic surface distance on FLAT_P, PLANE_P (35 deg), BORE_P (R 12, depth 24 mm), cells
